    "text": "Find a formula for the general term of the sequence \\[1, 9, 1, 9, 1, 9, \\dots\\]\n(i) \\(a_n = 5 + (-1)^n 4, \\forall n \\ge 1\\)\n(ii) \\(a_n = 1 + 8n, \\forall n \\ge 1\\)",
