    "text": "Đồ thị dưới đây có bao nhiêu cây khung (spanning trees)?\\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 460 220\" width=\"440\" height=\"210\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius:8px; display:block; margin:10px auto;\"><style>.node{fill:#0f172a;stroke:#000;stroke-width:1;} .lbl{font-family:sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;fill:#1e293b;} .edge{stroke:#0f172a;stroke-width:2.5;fill:none;}</style><line x1=\"45\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"95\" y2=\"45\" class=\"edge\"/><line x1=\"95\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"100\" class=\"edge\"/><line x1=\"150\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"130\" y2=\"175\" class=\"edge\"/><line x1=\"130\" y1=\"175\" x2=\"60\" y2=\"175\" class=\"edge\"/><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"175\" x2=\"45\" y2=\"100\" class=\"edge\"/><line x1=\"150\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"280\" y2=\"100\" class=\"edge\"/><path d=\"M 150 100 Q 215 145 280 100\" class=\"edge\"/><line x1=\"280\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"340\" y2=\"45\" class=\"edge\"/><line x1=\"340\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"100\" class=\"edge\"/><line x1=\"400\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"340\" y2=\"155\" class=\"edge\"/><line x1=\"340\" y1=\"155\" x2=\"280\" y2=\"100\" class=\"edge\"/><circle cx=\"45\" cy=\"100\" r=\"5\" class=\"node\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"105\" class=\"lbl\">a</text><circle cx=\"95\" cy=\"45\" r=\"5\" class=\"node\"/><text x=\"92\" y=\"32\" class=\"lbl\">b</text><circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"100\" r=\"5\" class=\"node\"/><text x=\"146\" y=\"85\" class=\"lbl\">c</text><circle cx=\"130\" cy=\"175\" r=\"5\" class=\"node\"/><text x=\"135\" y=\"195\" class=\"lbl\">d</text><circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"175\" r=\"5\" class=\"node\"/><text x=\"46\" y=\"195\" class=\"lbl\">e</text><circle cx=\"280\" cy=\"100\" r=\"5\" class=\"node\"/><text x=\"274\" y=\"85\" class=\"lbl\">f</text><circle cx=\"340\" cy=\"45\" r=\"5\" class=\"node\"/><text x=\"336\" y=\"32\" class=\"lbl\">g</text><circle cx=\"400\" cy=\"100\" r=\"5\" class=\"node\"/><text x=\"410\" y=\"105\" class=\"lbl\">h</text><circle cx=\"340\" cy=\"155\" r=\"5\" class=\"node\"/><text x=\"337\" y=\"178\" class=\"lbl\">i</text></svg>",
